    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brutal, Fast, and Free</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alien Grounds</strong> is a no-nonsense, fast-paced FPS where the difficulty ramps up <i>fast</i>.<br>It starts easy. Then it gets personal... and addictive.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard mode that earns its name</strong> \u2013 no tutorials, no mercy\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Easy mode available</strong> \u2013 for training or casual play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Every shot counts</strong> \u2013 smart aiming = higher scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Maps shift mid-battle</strong> \u2013 no two runs feel the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam achievements</strong>\u00a0\u2013 brutal challenges only a few will ever earn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant action</strong> \u2013 no cutscenes, no waiting, just fight</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll die. You\u2019ll retry. You\u2019ll get better.<br>And if you make it to Mission 100 on Hard\u2026 you\u2019ve earned bragging rights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pistol</strong> \u2013 Low damage, limited ammo. Best used for headshots. Starts in Mission #1.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatic Rifle</strong> \u2013 Recoil, bullet spread, and a scope. Ammo <strong>resupplies</strong> when low. Unlocks in Mission #2.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Laser Gun</strong> \u2013 No recoil, infinite energy, scoped \u2013 but it <strong>overheats</strong> with sustained fire. Unlocks in Mission #3.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity Gun</strong> \u2013 No recoil, infinite energy, scoped \u2013 but it <strong>speeds up time</strong>. Unlocks in Mission #4.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Annihilator</strong> \u2013 Annihilates nearby enemies. Short recharge delay. Activate with middle mouse button. Unlocks in Mission #5.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chem Gun</strong> \u2013 Won\u2019t kill a single enemy, but devastating against groups. No ammo or recoil. Unlocks in Mission #10.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Just play it!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions. No paywalls. Just a solo dev making a game that's fun, fair, and deadly. <br><strong>Hit Play and see how far you can go.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Technical Notes</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs on slower computers \u2013 tweak settings for better performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad friendly \u2013 raw input, aim assist, and sensitivity options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Y-Axis Invert \u2013 works for both mouse and gamepad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-handed keyboard and mouse setup supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck tested</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brutal, Fast, and Free</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alien Grounds</strong> is a no-nonsense, fast-paced FPS where the difficulty ramps up <i>fast</i>.<br>It starts easy. Then it gets personal... and addictive.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard mode that earns its name</strong> \u2013 no tutorials, no mercy\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Easy mode available</strong> \u2013 for training or casual play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Every shot counts</strong> \u2013 smart aiming = higher scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Maps shift mid-battle</strong> \u2013 no two runs feel the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam achievements</strong>\u00a0\u2013 brutal challenges only a few will ever earn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant action</strong> \u2013 no cutscenes, no waiting, just fight</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll die. You\u2019ll retry. You\u2019ll get better.<br>And if you make it to Mission 100 on Hard\u2026 you\u2019ve earned bragging rights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pistol</strong> \u2013 Low damage, limited ammo. Best used for headshots. Starts in Mission #1.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatic Rifle</strong> \u2013 Recoil, bullet spread, and a scope. Ammo <strong>resupplies</strong> when low. Unlocks in Mission #2.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Laser Gun</strong> \u2013 No recoil, infinite energy, scoped \u2013 but it <strong>overheats</strong> with sustained fire. Unlocks in Mission #3.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity Gun</strong> \u2013 No recoil, infinite energy, scoped \u2013 but it <strong>speeds up time</strong>. Unlocks in Mission #4.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Annihilator</strong> \u2013 Annihilates nearby enemies. Short recharge delay. Activate with middle mouse button. Unlocks in Mission #5.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chem Gun</strong> \u2013 Won\u2019t kill a single enemy, but devastating against groups. No ammo or recoil. Unlocks in Mission #10.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Just play it!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions. No paywalls. Just a solo dev making a game that's fun, fair, and deadly. <br><strong>Hit Play and see how far you can go.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Technical Notes</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs on slower computers \u2013 tweak settings for better performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad friendly \u2013 raw input, aim assist, and sensitivity options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Y-Axis Invert \u2013 works for both mouse and gamepad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-handed keyboard and mouse setup supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck tested</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Free 3D sci-fi FPS. Fast-paced and brutal - battle waves of killer robots in solo missions. Dodge fire, master advanced weapons, and survive across shifting alien grounds. Clean, minimal UI and highly optimized for smooth performance - designed for fast action and endless replayability.",
